OL,4,Bcorrect call?                          
OL,5,GLeny Yoro's eighth-minute red card was 
OL,6,Ga pivotal moment early in Mauricio     
OL,7,GPochettino's first game as Manchester  
OL,8,GUnited boss.                           
OL,10,FIt handed Liverpool the initiative at  
OL,11,FAnfield, and Andoni Iraola's players   
OL,12,Ftook advantage by scoring two goals in 
OL,13,Fquick succession.                      
OL,15,FShould it have been a red card though? 
OL,17,FWas there a case for the video         
OL,18,Fassistant referee (VAR) to suggest it  
OL,19,Fshould be downgraded to a yellow?      
